msgid ""
"**Saturation** - Define the level of saturation. Allowed values are between 1"
" and 1000 (default is 125) where 1 turns the image into greyscale."
msgstr ""
"**Saturación**: define o nivel de saturación. Permítense valores do 1 ao 1000"
" (o predeterminado é 125), sendo 1 converter a imaxe a escala de grises."

#~ msgid "This is the `Frei0r saturat0r <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterFrei0r-saturat0r/>`_ MLT filter."
#~ msgstr "Este é o filtro `saturat0r de Frei0r<https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterFrei0r-saturat0r/>`_ de MLT."

